  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="IT">Formazione e sviluppo delle capacit&#xe0; dei funzionari municipali in Libia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training and capacity development of municipal staff in Libya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="IT">L&apos;iniziativa intende contribuire a migliorare le condizioni di vita della popolazione in alcune Municipalit&#xe0; libiche, facilitando il loro accesso ai  servizi di base.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This initiative is designed to improve access to essential services for local communities in Libya, by strengthening the technical, managerial and organizational capacities of the municipalities and by fostering a culture of inclusive policy-making and service delivery at local level.</narrative>
  </description>
